# 👥 DuneRealm — Team System

## 🎯 Purpose

DuneRealm ka Team System specially DuneRealm ki long mystery story ko multiplayer aur cooperative experience banane ke liye hoga.

Player chahe to:

- Solo play kar sakta hai
- Friends ko invite kar sakta hai
- NPCs ko recruit kar sakta hai
- Friends + NPCs ki mixed team bana sakta hai

Team banana compulsory nahi hoga.

---

# 👤 Solo Exploration

Player bina kisi team ke poori DuneRealm mystery complete kar sakta hai.

Solo player ko story complete karne se roka nahi jayega.

Solo gameplay me player apne decisions aur investigation ke according progress karega.

---

# 👥 Friends Team

Player DuneRealm me enter karte waqt friends ko invite kar sakta hai.

Agar multiple players join karte hain, to sab:

- Ek hi story instance me honge
- Ek hi major story events dekhenge
- Ek hi ancient world experience karenge
- Ek hi mystery investigate karenge
- Ek doosre ke saath freely explore karenge
- Tasks aur clues ko aapas me divide kar sakenge

---

# 🤖 NPC Team

Agar player friends ko invite nahi karta ya additional help chahta hai, to NPCs ko team me recruit kiya ja sakta hai.

NPCs investigation aur exploration me player ki help kar sakte hain.

NPCs ko permanent fixed roles me lock nahi kiya jayega.

---

# 👥 Mixed Team

Player friends aur NPCs ko ek hi team me rakh sakta hai.

Example:

Player + 3 Friends + 2 NPCs

Sab ek hi shared story experience me participate karenge.

---

# 🌐 Dynamic Team Limit

DuneRealm ki maximum team size fixed nahi hogi.

Server performance aur current load ke according team capacity dynamically adjust ho sakti hai.

Possible examples:

- Low server load → Larger team
- Medium server load → Medium team
- High server load → Smaller team

Exact limits development aur server testing ke baad finalize ki jayengi.

Example testing limits:

5 → 10 → 20

Ye numbers final limits nahi hain.

---

# 🔄 Shared Story System

Team ke sabhi players ek hi story progression me participate karenge.

Agar 10 players ek saath past experience start karte hain, to sabhi ek hi shared ancient-world experience dekhenge.

Alag-alag players ke liye separate story version nahi banega.

---

# ⏳ Synchronized Story Events

Major story events team ke players ke liye synchronized honge.

Example:

Agar team past me enter karti hai:

Player 1 → Past me enter  
Player 2 → Past me enter  
Player 3 → Past me enter  
Player 4 → Past me enter

Sab ek hi event ke part honge.

---

# 🧩 No Fixed Roles

DuneRealm Team System me players ke permanent roles nahi honge.

Kisi player ko permanently:

- Investigator
- Explorer
- Historian
- Fighter
- Leader

jaise role me lock nahi kiya jayega.

Players khud decide karenge ki current situation me kaun kya karega.

---

# 🤝 Player Coordination

Team members ko communicate aur coordinate karna padega.

Example:

> "Tum ye clue investigate karo."

> "Main NPC se baat karta hoon."

> "Tum log hidden entrance check karo."

Players apni strategy khud bana sakte hain.

---

# 🔎 Duplicate Investigation

Agar do ya zyada players same clue ya task investigate karna chahte hain, to unhe unnecessarily different roles assign nahi kiye jayenge.

Players khud decide karenge ki kaun kya karega.

---

# 💰 NPC Recruitment

NPCs ko recruit karne ke liye player ko:

- NPC ko discover karna
- Usse interact karna
- Uska test/requirement complete karna
- Zaroorat ke according payment karna

pad sakta hai.

Har NPC automatically team me available nahi hoga.

---

# 🕵️ Unknown Characters

DuneRealm me kuch characters ki identity mysterious ho sakti hai.

Player ko har character ki actual identity immediately pata nahi chalegi.

Kuch characters ko samajhne ke liye investigation aur interaction karna padega.

---

# 🎮 Team Gameplay Philosophy

Team system ka main purpose sirf players ki quantity badhana nahi hai.

Team members:

- Saath explore karenge
- Clues discuss karenge
- Decisions lenge
- Mystery solve karenge
- Dangerous situations handle karenge
- Ancient world experience karenge
- Story ke funny moments enjoy karenge

---

# 🔒 Important Rules

- Team optional hai.
- Solo completion possible hai.
- Friends invite kiye ja sakte hain.
- NPCs recruit kiye ja sakte hain.
- Friends + NPCs ki mixed team possible hai.
- Team size server load ke according adjust ho sakti hai.
- Fixed player roles nahi honge.
- Major story events synchronized honge.
- Team ke sabhi players shared story instance me honge.
- Past experience team ke liye shared experience hoga.
- Past me repeat entry nahi hogi.

---

# ⭐ Core Principle

**Solo player → Complete the mystery alone.**

**Team player → Complete the same mystery together.**

**Friends + NPCs → Shared investigation experience.**

**No fixed roles → Players decide how to cooperate.**

**Dynamic capacity → Server performance decides practical team size.**